#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD9712 expect=skipped domain=TV
# Rule:Description: FDA-SD9712 — the Required key VISIT is not populated.
#note "VISIT is absent from TV, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(VISIT) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TV
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col VISITNUM type=Char
col ARMCD type=Char
---
S1      | TV     | 1        | A
---
